WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.540
Hey, my name is Koji Kabuto.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.890
Just like you, I'm just a normal boy.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.450
But, if one day you suddenly have more power than a human,

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.820
how will you use it?

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.420
Will you become a devil who destroys the world with that power?

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.600
Or will you become a hero who saves the world?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.180
I, Koji Kabuto, will suddenly receive that terrifying power.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.140
And that power is...

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.660
A titan robot with a terrifying fighting ability!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.930
MAJINGER Z!

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:39.840
You're a pain in the ass.

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:41.940
Dr. H!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.930
Don't be so angry.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.050
Don't regret it.

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:47.720
That's your destiny.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:48.780
Now,

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.360
everything is over.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:55.180
You will be completely defeated.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:57.100
Ah,

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.120
it's painful.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:01:59.180
I can't see you anymore.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:01:59.820
I'm going to cry.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.720
I will make you laugh in the bottom of hell.

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:08.360
Kabuto Koji!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.200
I regret and mourn his actions.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.020
But Koji...

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.640
Kabuto Koji is different.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.810
Kabuto Koji does not regret.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:40.150
That's right.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:41.660
I will not hesitate!

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.890
No matter how many times life repeats itself,

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.340
he will not be afraid to walk the same path.

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:51.550
That's right.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:52.660
No matter how many times...

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.460
No matter how many times I risk my life...

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.720
I will let go of this one shot!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.830
That is me!

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.850
Kabuto Koji!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.220
I'm out of here.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.460
Look at this power!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.800
Taki!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:41.100
Break the sea and create everything with this fist!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.400
Alright!

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.490
That's enough!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.000
Oji!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:54.750
From now on, you will surpass humans!

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.240
Come on!

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:56.660
Go!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:03:59.540
Big Bang!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.850
The 3rd Jirai Jisai is completely blown up!

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.860
We are currently moving to the 5th Area!

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.940
The intruders are approaching the final line!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.800
There are 3 more areas to the research facility!

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:50.830
Why are the other beasts...

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.140
We've captured the video of the intruders!

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.720
That's...

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.400
Shutter! Close the shutter!

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.140
Alarm! We're leaving final line!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:10.580
What!?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.040
Are you serious!?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.720
Shut up!

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:24.300
We're taking off!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.950
Make sure to get ready!

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:26.570
Roger!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.300
From now on, we will proceed with the Warlost capture operation as planned!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.060
Please! I hope we are safe!

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:49.160
We are prepared to contact the enemy at any time!

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:53.010
But, Father! I heard that Pigman is a tough guy!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:57.580
Hmph! I understand that you are a coward, but...

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.580
What? What is this?

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.490
Leave this to us, Sayaka-kun!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:09.020
Ah, no matter how good he is, he's still young in front of us.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:13.160
Look! Now is the time for the power of the Koushiryoku to shine!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.020
Koshitto!

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:16.480
Uwaaaaaaah!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:22.660
Look! The barrier is complete!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.000
Really! As expected of Professor Watson!

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:25.860
But!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.450
It can't be that he's going to go out without Majinga!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.260
Gouji-kun will definitely come!

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.690
With the Maginger Z!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.130
And we'll put an end to everything in this world!

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:53.970
I'm not in a hurry to do anything.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.710
But now that it's started...

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:58.720
Okuromi!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:06:59.220
Hm?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:06.090
We've just received a report that the High Power Research Institute is in the middle of a war against the Pigmans.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:12.420
That boy is trying to fight against the High Power by himself.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.260
He's grown up.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.930
Well, that's fine. I've got my hands on him.

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:20.810
But more importantly...

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:39.120
I'm not in a hurry.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.880
He won't fall just because of that.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.570
But...

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.980
No, we won't move here.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:52.100
Now, we'll wait without moving.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.120
He'll come.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.080
Yes, he'll come along with Shoki.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.890
That's when...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.280
It's time for you to settle the score for the next seven years!

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:03.690
Let's go!

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.520
Let's settle the score!

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.060
Let's settle the score!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.480
Now, I will hand over the title to the champion of this world, Dr. Hell,

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:11.580
the one who will fish for the title.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:15.680
Blocking action!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:16.780
Yes, sir!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.910
One of Dr. Hell's five large troops,

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:23.090
along with the Tetsuchuji army and the flying Hikaiju,

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.160
will begin the battle!

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.860
And then, they will rise!

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.970
I, Boudou of the Empire!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.130
I'm a machine-monster who came from within the World Stone.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.690
Whenever I see you, I get excited.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:50.240
Haha, that's all thanks to my master, Dr. Hell's power.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:52.340
This Ashura Danjaku...

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.880
This time for sure, this battle...

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.300
Let's bring out the secret weapon of victory!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.490
Then go, Ashura army!

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:21.190
So this is the end of the town of Atami, huh?

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:25.470
I wonder how much trouble I've had to go through to get here.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:29.980
But once this battle is over, I'll have nothing left to lose.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:33.250
I will be left behind. I will lose my foe, Kouji Kabuto.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:36.390
What a pitiful guy.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:40.260
Without knowing anything, I feel the joy of such an act.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:45.370
It's you! Nishiki Yori Tsubasa!

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:48.940
That's right. I'm the woman who gives you the greatest joy!

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.130
What did you say?!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.000
Hmph, this Atami is going to be crushed anyway.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:10.500
If that's the case, it won't be fun if it's half-and-half, will it?

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:14.550
I'm going to do it!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.750
Minato-shu from Kurogane-ya!

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:17.470
What!?

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.990
Hey, what's going on?

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:05.660
If this goes on, it'll be a missile!

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.480
I'm going to blow up a missile!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:16.700
Okay, let's do it.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:26.140
You're good.

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.560
W-what's with them?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.030
Let me hear you say you don't need it!

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:37.040
My name is Boss Brut!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.280
Are you okay, Boss Brut?

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.400
Shut up!

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:43.000
You'll pay for this!

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:45.290
You'll pay for this!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.940
How dare you, Ajiwazanshaku!

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:08.570
You've suffered so much humiliation, and yet you still want to defy Dr. Hell?

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.180
That voice!

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.320
Are you the Golden Typhoon?

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:18.120
I am the Golden Typhoon!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:29.580
What's with this temple?!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.590
Something's coming out!

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:59.750
What the...

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:06.670
Me? I am omnipotent, the one who protects and guides you.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:15.300
My name is Zeus, but its real form is the Z-Maginger.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:29.260
Long ago, the Greek ancestor Mycenaeus was protected by a legendary titan soldier.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.900
He conquered the movie in their territory, Bird's Island.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:39.430
However, at some point, he disappeared from this earth with his strongest military power.

00:13:41.030 --> 00:13:44.810
By the hand of the god called Zeus,

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:59.980
I'm not going to let you get away with this.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.460
His name is Z Maginger.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.520
You know that, don't you?

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:03.940
Yes.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:11.340
He is the hero of the ancient Mycenae.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.500
And the god who protected the world in the Shinhwa era.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.850
The god who has the name of all-power.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:19.500
Zeus.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.240
So we met after all.

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:28.880
He has a very troublesome bloodline.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:39.440
Dr. Chuzo was also shown by Dr. Dr. Hell's invitation.

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:46.480
Open the door he kept protecting.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.060
The one who was sleeping in that room was the wonderful Shinwanoi-san.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:20.480
I'm the king!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:26.320
I'm Minakari!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.750
I-I didn't see anything!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:33.160
That's why!

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:38.180
That's why my happiness might be here right now.

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:41.770
Everything is as you say.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.060
But this child doesn't have a mother.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:49.050
I'm a mother who always protects her child.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:54.770
No, what happened at that time was right.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.920
Thanks to you, I was saved.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:00.690
No way.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.040
I wonder.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:07.900
I can go back in time in front of this girl.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.040
That's what I feel.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:13.480
But I'm a traitor after all.

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:16.620
And there's no way I'm going to live with that this time.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:22.690
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:43.070
Are you really a living being?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:46.480
My name is Kedra. I am a soldier of Ikeene.

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:49.010
I have been educated to destroy other civilizations.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:55.160
I have a fighting brain, so I will destroy everything.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.720
Destroy, destroy, destroy.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:16:58.860
You!

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.800
I will kill all the scum in the world!

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:10.580
I will kill them all!

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:11.450
I will destroy them all!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.800
You've been a pain in the neck.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:27.440
But your life will be the sacrifice of my curse!

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:29.410
Father!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:32.310
Don't let them get away!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.450
Come on! Come on!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:08.920
Sayaka!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.290
What about the Hajinger Army?

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.190
Well, you did well.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.490
You guys did well.

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:18.130
I'm satisfied.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:18.990
Father!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:29.300
It seems that you want to go to that world with your parents.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.800
If that's what you want, then let me destroy you!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:42.730
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:47.500
You know, I'm the new member of the national power, Keibu Ankokuji and Maihane.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.090
I'm Gyu-Gyu-Gyu's Gyu-chan!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:52.570
No, I'm Gamia Q3.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.680
Gamia!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:54.260
You!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:57.640
What?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.610
What did you do to me?

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:04.120
It's just a little special.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:05.840
You bastard!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.620
What the hell is that?

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.600
You don't remember, do you?

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:20.320
Don't tell me you're...

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.440
That's right! His name is Blade!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:26.160
And this is...

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:26.480
What?

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.410
You bastard!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:37.370
Don't worry about it. We're the only ones who can help you.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:44.000
In this case, I'll use all the bombs and machines that Ghoul has to bomb the Koshirof Research Institute.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:48.890
All units, gather! Target, Koshirof Research...

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.980
What's that?

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:55.050
Big Bang Punch!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.180
The Majinger Corps!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.300
My friends!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:14.460
The Koshiroku Research Institute!

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:18.680
And...

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:28.020
Koji Amuto!

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:37.290
Baku, I will make you my enemy from now on!

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:38.360
What?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.570
Stand up, machine gun!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:45.760
Broken Brick Schneider!

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.650
Come on!

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:49.610
Breath of Fire!

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:50.470
Cool!

00:20:58.240 --> 00:20:58.460
What?

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:12.100
Don't block my way of life!

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:19.510
Then I, Dr. L, will risk my own life to kill you!

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:23.620
Go! World Spawn!

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:40.180
This is the end.

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:43.200
No, we haven't lost yet!

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.700
We can still fight!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.510
We can't afford to lose!

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:51.950
We can't afford to be crushed!

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:54.940
Taika! Boss! Everyone!

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:57.400
Let's go!

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.850
KURUNARA!

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:08.360
If I have the Mazinger Z, I can love the world!

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:10.380
I can be a god or a demon!

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:15.700
But I can't be a god, and I don't want to be a demon!

00:22:16.720 --> 00:22:19.150
But I will fight!

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:23.450
To protect the peace of the world, with this Mazinger Z!

00:22:30.990 --> 00:22:31.010
We'll be right back.

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:30.680
You
